          "routine_id": null,
          "run_id": "31751f37-1132-442f-a129-9de98b53a7c4",
          "purpose": "conversation",
          "source_run_id": null,
          "text": "Proving the local fixture sign-in — opening your granted browser profile.The first navigation didn't go through — checking browser state to reconcile before retrying.That dispatch was stale — I'll retry the navigation with a clean state.Sign-in name entered — inspecting fresh state before submitting.Note entered — saving it now.Second tab confirms the saved note — capturing its screenshot.Done.\n\n- Signed in with proof name `muse-browser-proof` via local fixture form at `/login`.\n- Account page at `/account` shows: `Verified account muse-browser-proof`.\n- Saved Persistent note `muse-note-84012`. Account state shows: `Saved note: muse-note-84012`.\n- Opened second managed tab at `/second` with `new_tab=true`. Its DOM shows the same `Verified account muse-browser-proof` and `Saved note: muse-note-84012`. Screenshot confirms both visible on the second tab.",
          "state": "complete",
          "artifact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "6f27b2e1-6724-4381-8ac6-569ed37fe38c",
          "owner_id": "7ba9c73a-373f-403b-9d70-2e1696a447cf",
          "revision": 1,
