          "purpose": "conversation",
          "source_run_id": null,
          "text": "Checking persistence after the restart — reattaching the same profile without signing in again.The account persisted without sign-in — capturing evidence and verifying the second tab.Persistence verified without signing in again:\n\n- Navigated directly to `/account` in the same `Browser proof muse` profile after restart.\n- Observed: `Verified account muse-browser-proof` and `Saved note: muse-note-84012`, with the note also present in the input field.\n- Screenshot of `/account` confirms both values visible.\n- Opened second managed tab at `/second` with `new_tab=true`. Its state shows the same `Verified account muse-browser-proof` and `Saved note: muse-note-84012`. No sign-in or retyping was performed.",
          "state": "complete",
          "artifact_ids": []
        },
        {
