          "text": "Verifying the revoked session — checking the account state without logging in.Navigating to `/account` now lands on `/login`.\n\nFresh state shows `Signed out`, a `Proof name` input, and a `Sign in to local fixture` button. The verified account and saved note are no longer visible.\n\nSign-in is required. I did not log in or submit the form.",
